  "result": "Excellent! All 53 tests pass. I've added invoice numbering with these components:\n\n**New `src/numbering.js`:**\n- **`nextInvoiceNumber(existingNumbers, issueDate)`** \u2014 Generates the next invoice number in the format `INV-<year>-<counter>` where counter is 4-digit zero-padded (0001-9999) and restarts annually.\n\n**New `issueInvoice()` in `src/invoices.js`:**\n- Assigns the next available number to an invoice\n- Changes status from 'draft' to 'issued'\n- Returns NOT_DRAFT if the invoice isn't in draft status\n- Never mutates input\n\n**Tests added:**\n- 8 tests for nextInvoiceNumber covering: empty array, incrementing, finding max, ignoring other years, year rollover, zero-padding, malformed numbers, and large counters\n- 4 tests for issueInvoice covering: assignment, sequencing, non-draft rejection, and no mutation",
